# Lower Quarter Gothic-SciFi V2 — Reviewed Extract

This pack contains the reviewed subset of the latest generated Lower Quarter sheet.

Contents:
- 20 selected prop assets
- 14 selected wall/architecture assets
- native source-scale RGBA extracts under `asset_drop/source_work/.../v2_extract/`
- 0.5x runtime derivatives under `content/sprites/.../gothic_scifi_native_v2/`
- semantic extraction manifest with source rectangles and output sizes
- reviewed combined source image for provenance

Runtime conversion intentionally follows the live Lower Quarter Gothic-SciFi builder's core contract:
- one global 0.5x scale
- no per-asset autofit
- 48-color shared palette per source family
- binary runtime alpha after cutoff 16
- visual-only; no collision/navigation authority is supplied

The source image contained residual very-low-alpha matte pixels from generation.
The extraction pass hard-zeroed alpha <= 16 before cropping. Runtime PNG alpha is binary 0/255.

Recommended use:
1. Extract this ZIP at the CUSTODIAN repository root.
2. Review `gothic_scifi_native_v2` in the mapper before replacing V1 references.
3. Keep gameplay bounds/collision authored separately.
4. If approved, have Codex register/consume the V2 semantic manifest and migrate selected placements.

Not included:
- duplicated lamp/crate/rubble variants
- giant hero-cathedral facades
- ornamental pieces that would over-dress the Ritualant cavern
